Triage merged incoming date reports by subject line alone into `#4471`. Grouping those reports by tenant locale and booking form channel shows separate underlying bugs rather than one shared issue.

<Callout kind="warn">
Subject matching merged distinct bugs into <code>#4471</code>. Each cause needs its own ticket and fix.
</Callout>

## Causes merged into `#4471`

- **`parser`:** The shared date parser reads dates month first (`MM/DD`), while day-first European tenants write the day first (`DD/MM`) across `app`, `email`, and `booking-v2` form submissions.
- **`hint`:** The `booking-v3` web form prints `MM/DD/YYYY` under the date input for day-first tenants (`alder.physio`, `copper.studio`, `pale.harbour`), so visitors type month first while the form parses day first.

